          "concept": "Reactive forms build the form model in the component class with FormGroup and FormControl, which makes the model explicit, testable, and easy to validate. Validators such as Validators.required and Validators.email attach to controls, and the form's valueChanges observable streams every keystroke. Complex forms — dynamic lists, cross-field rules — are where reactive forms earn their keep. The debugging exercise below shows a typical slip with Angular reactive forms — study it before you start the exercise.",
