          "concept": "FastAPI endpoints can be async def, which lets them await database calls and HTTP requests without blocking the server. A sync endpoint runs in a threadpool, so mixing the two is safe, but calling a blocking library inside an async endpoint stalls every request. Deployment runs the app with Uvicorn behind a web server, with Gunicorn managing worker processes in production. The debugging exercise below shows a typical slip with FastAPI async endpoints and deployment — study it before you start the exercise.",
